  "rule": "Paper only. Each stock pick (call for a BUY pick, put for a SELL pick) is bought when the share crosses its entry between 09:30 and 10:30, while still within 1% of it: 1 lot in each budget, the strike nearest the money (priced Rs 2 or more) costing up to Rs 5,000, Rs 5,000-10,000 and Rs 10,000-15,000. Stop -30%, cost after +20%, trail from +40%, book +60%, else close 15:15. Costs Rs 100 + 1.5% each way.",
